#ASSERT (`the answer on the register for the NPO body corporate on 2 October 2026`)'s `section the entity is entered in` EQUALS JUST `the general section`
#ASSERT (`the answer on the register for the NPO body corporate on 1 December 2025`)'s `the entity is a registered charity`
-- Article 8(3)(a)(i) asks which sub-paragraph of Article 2(1) the entity falls within, and, only for (f) to (j), whether it also falls within (a); (a)(ii) asks for details of the enactment or foreign law only for (e), (g), (h) or (j).
-- Sub-paragraph (ba) is none of these, so neither is owed (the amendment of 2025 did not touch Article 8(3)(a): trap T5).
#ASSERT (`Art 8(3)(a) the note of the status of the entity` ((fleet)'s `reading of Articles 8 to 10`) `the NPO body corporate as an entity on 2 October 2026`)'s `sub-paragraphs of Article 2(1) within which the entity falls` EQUALS LIST `a body corporate that is an NPO established under the law of Jersey`
#ASSERT (`Art 8(3)(a) the note of the status of the entity` ((fleet)'s `reading of Articles 8 to 10`) `the NPO body corporate as an entity on 2 October 2026`)'s `whether it also falls within sub-paragraph (a)` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`Art 8(3)(a) the note of the status of the entity` ((fleet)'s `reading of Articles 8 to 10`) `the NPO body corporate as an entity on 2 October 2026`)'s `sub-paragraphs for which details of the enactment or foreign law are required` EQUALS EMPTY
-- The principal address (Article 8(4)): its constitutional Law requires no registered office in Jersey, so (a) does not apply; (b) the main premises in Jersey, which are not a private dwelling house.
GIVETH A `Register entry in the case`
`the register entry of the NPO body corporate with main premises` MEANS
    `Register entry in the case` WITH
        body IS (`the register entry of the NPO body corporate`)'s body
        `charity test facts` IS (`the register entry of the NPO body corporate`)'s `charity test facts`
        placements IS (`the register entry of the NPO body corporate`)'s placements
        `registration number` IS "C-0977"
        `registered name` IS "Les Amis du Jardin"
        `alternative registered names` IS EMPTY
        `date registered` IS YMD 2025 12 1
        `date deregistered` IS NOTHING
        `registered charitable purposes` IS LIST "to advance education in Jersey"
        `registered public benefit statement` IS "A garden open to the public"
        `Order under Article 28` IS `Int fx no Order under Article 28`
        `Order under Article 13(9)` IS NOTHING
        `relief Orders under Article 13(10)` IS EMPTY
        `facts for the items of Article 8(3)` IS (`Int fx the register entry of the school company`)'s `facts for the items of Article 8(3)`
        `facts for the items of Article 8(5)` IS `Int fx facts for the items of Article 8(5) with the placements` EMPTY
        `facts for the public elements` IS (`Int fx the register entry of the school company`)'s `facts for the public elements`
        `facts for the principal address` IS `the facts of a body with main premises in Jersey`
        `notices served` IS EMPTY
#ASSERT (`Int (b) is the entity a registered charity and what does the register hold` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) `the register entry of the NPO body corporate with main premises`)'s `the addresses that may be entered as the principal address` EQUALS LIST "La Rue du Jardin, St Peter"
#ASSERT (`Int (b) is the entity a registered charity and what does the register hold` fleet (YMD 2026 10 2) `the register entry of the NPO body corporate with main premises`)'s `the entity has a principal address in Jersey`
